	<ul>
		<li>
			<strong>Tài liệu Kotlin chính thức (kotlinlang.org):</strong> Classes (constructor properties) · Data Classes
			(equality, copy, destructuring) · Object declarations · Generics: type parameters
			(<code>List&lt;T&gt;</code> recognition) · Delegated properties (khái niệm <code>by</code>) · Sealed classes/interfaces.
		</li>
		<li>
